ing includes stage lighting, formal attire (black dress, tuxedo/suit), and a trophy on a pedestal — consistent with a formal awards ceremony.\n\n---\n\n### **6) Hostess-Ronaldo interaction on stage**  \n✅ Confirmed. From frame 12 through 17, Amanda Davies and Ronaldo are standing face-to-face on stage, engaged in conversation. She holds the mic toward him as he prepares to speak.\n\n---\n\n### **Critical Error in Answer “4” — “He fist-bumped with the presenter”**\n\n❌ **This is factually incorrect based on the frames.**\n\n- **No fist bump occurs** between Ronaldo and Amanda Davies at any point in these 30 frames.\n- In frames 12–17, they are standing apart, with Amanda holding the microphone and Ronaldo listening or preparing to speak.\n- There is **no physical contact** of any kind — not even a handshake — let alone a fist bump.\n- The phrase “He fist-bumped with the presenter” is also grammatically misleading — it implies Ronaldo initiated the action with the presenter, which is not only untrue but also misattributes agency.\n\n---\n\n### **Conclusion:**\n\nThe correct answer should describe Amanda Davies **welcoming Ronaldo with a microphone, speaking to him, and gesturing as he approaches the stage** — not a fist bump.\n\n✅ **Answer ‘4’ is incorrect.**\n\n--- \n\n**Final Verdict: FALSE.**'}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/7HjNIPIgUg4/frames/frame_4957.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/7HjNIPIgUg4/frames/frame_4958.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/7HjNIPIgUg4/frames/frame_4959.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/7HjNIPIgUg4/frames/frame_4960.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/7HjNIPIgUg4/frames/frame_4993.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/7HjNIPIgUg4/frames/frame_4994.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/7HjNIPIgUg4/frames/frame_4995.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/7HjNIPIgUg4/frames/frame_4996.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbenc